<title>UK: DSL unit adds 100 million marks to bond.</title>
<headline>DSL unit adds 100 million marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 350 million marks from 250 million marks, lead manager SBC Warburg said.  There is a new issue price.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DSL BANK</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.44    PAY DATE  S-07.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/IBCA AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.525     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
